Scope
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This BSD-3-Clause license applies only to the WhaleOS-authored wrapper
files inside this ebuild's files/ directory:

  * CMakeLists.txt
  * arc-toolchain-t-x86-android.cmake
  * arc-toolchain-t-x86_64-android.cmake
  * 0001-cros_gralloc-plane-stride-offset-fallback.patch
  * 0002-gbm_mesa-reshape-spoofed-format-on-import-and-map.patch

The upstream tarballs shipped alongside them retain their own upstream
licenses:

  * files/waydroid-minigbm-*.tar.gz  -> Apache-2.0 / BSD / MIT
                                       (see the tarball's top-level LICENSE
                                        and Android.bp license_kinds)
  * files/waydroid-libdrm-*.tar.gz   -> per-file MIT
                                       (build-time header reference only;
                                        libdrm at runtime is provided by
                                        the container's vendor libdrm.so
                                        and, on the host side, by
                                        x11-libs/libdrm which carries its
                                        own chromiumos credit entry)
